This is a read that will be used for input control in Step 8 (Peak analysis with DANPOS).
This is an example of a fastq file.
The fastq files can be in the same directory (like in this example) or in different directories inside the "reads/" dir
E.g.,
	- chromatin-assembly/data/template/reads/flowcell_1/
	- chromatin-assembly/data/template/reads/flowcell_2/
